WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:20.028
Kip was reading a newspaper.

2
00:00:20.029 --> 00:00:24.286
He saw an ad for Ocean Aquarium.

3
00:00:24.287 --> 00:00:28.721
"Hmm . . . ," thought Kip.

4
00:00:28.722 --> 00:00:31.606
"The aquarium looks like fun.

5
00:00:31.607 --> 00:00:41.136
Maybe Bird would like to go with me."

6
00:00:41.137 --> 00:00:45.604
Kip climbed up the tree.

7
00:00:45.605 --> 00:00:50.863
"Hey, Bird," he called. "Do you want to . . .?"

8
00:00:50.864 --> 00:00:53.587
But Bird was not in her nest.

9
00:00:53.588 --> 00:01:01.448
"Where is Bird?" Kip wondered.

10
00:01:01.449 --> 00:01:05.737
Kip climbed back down the tree.

11
00:01:05.738 --> 00:01:09.313
"She must be somewhere around here," he said.

12
00:01:09.314 --> 00:01:19.801
"I'll go and look for her."

13
00:01:19.802 --> 00:01:24.959
Meanwhile Bird was reading a newspaper too.

14
00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:31.370
"Hmm . . . ," thought Bird.

15
00:01:31.371 --> 00:01:35.118
"The aquarium looks like fun.

16
00:01:35.119 --> 00:01:40.961
Maybe Kip would like to go with me."

17
00:01:40.962 --> 00:01:46.728
Bird flew back to the tree.

18
00:01:46.729 --> 00:01:55.609
"Hey, Kip," she called. "Do you want to—?"

19
00:01:55.610 --> 00:02:00.474
But Kip was not in his hole.

20
00:02:00.475 --> 00:02:03.789
"Where is Kip?" Bird wondered.
